  "Stacking from decoded frames: 9.2 s with OpenCV, 15.1 s with the image layer, as Lanczos runs about three times slower.",
  "One mistake was found by these measures: padding a region mirrored at the tile, where OpenCV reads the image around it; every demosaic tile joint was wrong until fixed. The oracle now compares a region too."
